  "description": "Find the number of complete rows in a staircase built with n coins.",
  "target": 5,
  "pseudocode": "1. left = 1, right = n\n2. while left <= right:\n3. mid = left + (right - left) / 2\n4. coinsNeeded = mid * (mid + 1) / 2\n5. if coinsNeeded == n: return mid\n6. if coinsNeeded < n: left = mid + 1\n7. else: right = mid - 1\n8. return right",
